  "ingredients": [
    "4 large baking potatoes",
    "8 slices bacon",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, divided",
    "8 green onions, sliced, divided",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "4 tablespoons butter",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NSfgNPpYXHSJQ_keEol_5e-OyDQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-01-1598-78266aba7f4949a88c8f0f45fa58bebf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake potatoes in the preheated oven until tender, about 1 hour. Set potatoes aside until cool enough to handle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hccG1sDlJ4MHL2RtYxhFGsPYq_A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-02-1599-45e63000878b4f408cdc5f10fb712410.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook bacon in a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat until evenly brown. Drain, crumble, and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ubVeZ0zxMay7uqTnAzddTqua5No=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-03-1600-7b23012e72064e6297628d204f703a49.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice potatoes in half lengthwise; scoop flesh into a large bowl. Reserve skins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WgKjs40vRgXHbsS-WH4uu9CWHvA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-04-1603-24ea1395b2804e2da24fa1dd805c44df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sour cream, ½ cup cheese, ½ green onions, milk, butter, salt, and black pepper to potato flesh; mix with a hand mixer until well blended and creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DNbqxDmUdq9Xus08wtIjuiVcIIQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-05-11605-7ae53c17df3c458ebee610ca23e669f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon potato mixture into reserved potato skins; top with remaining ½ cup cheese, remaining ½ green onions, and bacon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AccHrR1EDFhojLLUeyHRD8zuBDw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-step-06-1608-e8f1104a4f334030b43e321f79f5751f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated until cheese is melted, about 15 minutes. Serve Hot!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qcZxB4VshYreKE0aOnocvXUlfUs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24332-ultimate-twice-baked-potato-DDMFS-4x3-1643-94592bde74914b7498d59c19c2d5e5ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24332/step_07.webp"
